{"id":"59c5498c726aa6df","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md","title":"Resolvent Set","display":"df-resolvent-set — Resolvent Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-resolvent-set","aliases":["58-df-resolvent-set"],"display":"df-resolvent-set — Resolvent Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-banach-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-resolvent-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-resolvent-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resolvent-set — Resolvent Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"58-df-banach-algebra\">58-df-banach-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\">\\((A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\)</span> (complex Banach algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"58-df-banach-algebra\">58-df-banach-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in A\">\\(x \\in A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> (spectral parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> (identity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\)</span> (Banach-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"58-df-banach-algebra\">58-df-banach-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_A(x)\">\\(\\rho_A(x)\\)</span> (resolvent set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_A(x)\">\\(\\sigma_A(x)\\)</span> (Banach-algebra spectrum defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Invertible}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}unital}\\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}unital}\\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}invertible}\\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A=b\\cdot a)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}invertible}\\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A=b\\cdot a)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\rho_A(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\rho_A(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\to R_A(\\lambda,x)\\coloneqq(\\lambda1_A-x)^{-1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\to R_A(\\lambda,x)\\coloneqq(\\lambda1_A-x)^{-1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\sigma_A(x)\\coloneqq\\mathbb C\\setminus\\rho_A(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\sigma_A(x)\\coloneqq\\mathbb C\\setminus\\rho_A(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In a complex unital Banach algebra, the resolvent set is open and the spectrum is nonempty and compact.</li>\n<li>Resolvent satisfies Hilbert identity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\lambda, x) - R(\\mu, x) = (\\mu - \\lambda)R(\\lambda, x)R(\\mu, x)\">\\(R(\\lambda, x) - R(\\mu, x) = (\\mu - \\lambda)R(\\lambda, x)R(\\mu, x)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The resolvent is analytic on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_A(x)\">\\(\\rho_A(x)\\)</span>. Spectral points need not be eigenvalues or poles; pole behavior occurs only at suitable isolated spectral points.</li>\n<li>Laurent expansion around spectral values encodes spectral projections.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-banach-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-banach-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (complex Banach algebra, see [[58-df-banach-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-banach-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)$ (Banach-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-banach-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"1_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Invertible}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}unital}\\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A)\\land1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(1_A\\cdot a=a=a\\cdot1_A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}invertible}\\vdash \\mathrm{Invertible}_S(a;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A\\land\\exists b\\in A\\;(a\\cdot b=1_A=b\\cdot a)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\rho_A(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C:\\mathrm{Invertible}_S(\\lambda1_A-x;A,\\cdot,1_A)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\lambda\\in\\rho_A(x)\\to R_A(\\lambda,x)\\coloneqq(\\lambda1_A-x)^{-1}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resolvent\\text{-}spectrum} \\vdash \\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)\\land x\\in A\\to\\sigma_A(x)\\coloneqq\\mathbb C\\setminus\\rho_A(x)","display":true},{"tex":"R(\\lambda, x) - R(\\mu, x) = (\\mu - \\lambda)R(\\lambda, x)R(\\mu, x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_A(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"83c37bed44770f30","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Invertible}_S$ (代数内可逆谓词, see [[../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md]])"},{"id":"8d8851700a6e1ac3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UnitalBanachAlgebra}_S(A,+,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|_A,1_A)$ (unital Banach-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-resolvent-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1085","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-resolvent-set.md|58-df-resolvent-set]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["630c319f5a2106ce"]}